{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "089e84d970e0ebe679a7cd0b419139267b8f02c6510a5af6b35668cebdfd63d8", "ja": "へぇ、こんなプランもあるんだ。\n……わっ、こっちのプランもすごいな～！", "zh": "原来还有这样的方案啊。\n……哇，这边的方案也好厉害啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ba66af9f30414d9481bbefc88bef31a553c84a65185d434ec51cfd8d08fa658b", "ja": "お疲れ様、真。\nなんだか楽しそうだけど、何を見てるんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，真。\n看起来好像很开心，你在看什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "8b8e0a7b319b1f520dd1383363db92700df14d7cef11e627c6c3986bbd5c47d8", "ja": "あ、お疲れさまです、{$P$}！\n『ハピマリ』……ブライダル雑誌ですよ。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，{$P$}！\n《幸福婚礼》……是婚庆杂志。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "75898a011db67b130126d9e21ab93bad6dfc5a0b6710dfaa9f06eff579fd1b1a", "ja": "この前お仕事をしたグラビア雑誌の出版社さんが、\nバックナンバーを送ってくれたんです。", "zh": "之前一起工作过的写真杂志出版社，把过刊寄给我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d03b105aae320d5ba4d4c723992aa0136b642cb1eba59906c04737929545afca", "ja": "なるほど。けどさすがに、\n高校生が読むには早すぎないか？", "zh": "原来如此。不过说实话，高中生看这个是不是还是太早了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "b5ba661eb37c46d2df43d8701a34b01db0b8d503ae305e3af594a46900eb3c6d", "ja": "そんなことないです！　結婚式への憧れに、\n年齢なんて関係ないですよ！", "zh": "才不是那回事！对婚礼的憧憬，和年龄什么的才没有关系呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1006_p", "source_sha256": "457bf39e13d7b47a25c3a67f8b5ee76913bdec98399fe4b9f41b3b01e0bc652d", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nそれで、何か気になるページでもあったのか？", "zh": "这、这样啊……  \n所以，你是看到什么感兴趣的页面了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "88be69391be04fc92f6e03bf8aebc029039ca07581502ea734827bf2897736b9", "ja": "それなんですけど、見てくださいよこれ！\n一言で結婚式っていっても……。", "zh": "就是这个，您看！\n虽说都是婚礼……可也分好多种。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "5e1fecfc7f9a1feab881c715111249aaaf7a8b1127ad2d4481732ab965fc0b36", "ja": "こーんなにいろいろプランがあるんですよ！\nいろんな場所で……どれもすっごくステキで……。", "zh": "竟然有这么多种方案！\n地点也各不相同……每一种都特别棒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2f25a75ae8707316a90dd551704862fd3fc575967b950e3a668e1d0e4897f708", "ja": "どれどれ。海の上に学校に……スカイダイビング！？\nすごいな。そんなものまであるのか……。", "zh": "我看看都有些什么。海上、学校……还有跳伞！？  \n真厉害，连这种都有啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "03097680873ba2718971439b44627bde296be931c0cbcd5b993bd494a108a9fb", "ja": "ビックリですよね！　でもきっと、花嫁さんにとっては\n忘れられない思い出になるんだろうなぁ……♪", "zh": "很让人惊讶吧！不过对新娘来说，\n一定会成为一段难忘的回忆吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7df74b27a91a16d7a73df0fc999f56e6250587642c6b8e1ce6b939d9f5ddff8e", "ja": "確かに、空から落ちながら愛を誓い合うなんて、\n普通の経験じゃないもんな。", "zh": "确实，在从天而降的过程中互诉爱意，可不是什么普通的经历啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e1dbe75561cd0438508a535d0b9557e502a80091e12548069d96d20033a0b959", "ja": "ちなみに真は、どんな結婚式を挙げたいんだ？", "zh": "顺便问一下，真想举办什么样的婚礼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "b9b862febafe34901357d534704a6900d3dc0577edf03b4ccd145b9c2a3368bb", "ja": "うーん……海も空もステキだと\n思いますけど……やっぱり普通が一番かもしれません。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得海边和天空下的婚礼都很棒……不过，果然还是普通的婚礼最好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e2f78fd8a5002ce666ae850d4b1ef2a9ff9ebd28f6a2e5ad40a0b090405bf368", "ja": "あれ、そうなのか？　ちょっと意外だな。", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？还真有点意外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "2b3bea74c76fbd91ca95ffc05ff62f51dd8a5a8665509bbe79b1906cf15f7320", "ja": "そうですか？　キレイなドレスを着て、二人で\n愛を誓い合えれば、それだけで幸せだなって……。", "zh": "是吗？如果能穿上漂亮的礼服，两个人互相许下爱的誓言，那样就已经很幸福了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "f90c9a70e50d833d682b181e2be59292e9720a549b4e6b7781ad735f7e25e20f", "ja": "そして式場を出たら、新郎の王子様とハネムーンで、\n白馬に乗って世界中を旅したりして……えへへ♪", "zh": "然后走出婚礼会场，就和王子殿下般的新郎一起去度蜜月，骑着白马环游世界什么的……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1017_p", "source_sha256": "998f55461741583a5adcc348230f311d96fad4ee31e008d0f60ba508036f801d", "ja": "（それは十分普通じゃないのでは……と\n指摘するのは野暮だし、そっとしておくか）", "zh": "那已经算不上普通了吧……现在指出来未免太扫兴，还是别管她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0253_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "f0d961a12c37a54d1b957418c612619ac0843007bc3bec5856333dfcf7973f75", "ja": "それで、最後はステキなお城で妖精さんに迎えられて\n……って、{$P$}！　聞いてます？", "zh": "然后，最后在漂亮的城堡里由小精灵迎接……等等，{$P$}！您有在听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
